<title>CANADA: Stelco to proceed with furnace project.</title>
<headline>Stelco to proceed with furnace project.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ontario 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stelco Inc's Hilton Works Business Unit said on Wednesday it will proceed with plans to install a walking beam bloom reheat furnace at the Bloom and Billet Mill.</p>
<p>This C$25 million project will result in a significant improvement in billet quality and mill productivity, strengthening the rod and bar business, Hilton Works said.</p>
<p>The Salem Furnace Company is scheduled to complete the turnkey project by the first quarter of 1998.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
